WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Step the left foot back, heel turned down at 45°, hips facing forward.

2
00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Bend the front knee over the ankle.

3
00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Sweep the arms overhead, biceps by the ears, palms facing.

4
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Lift the chest, soften the shoulders, and gaze forward or up. Switch sides.
